  (text "DATA IN: 3.3 V or 5 V -> R10 -> 74AHCT1G125 -> 5 V. R7 holds DIN low when unplugged."
    (at 22.86 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ca760030-be77-4793-b462-522ef2fadee8")
  )
  (text "12 V in: SMAJ15A TVS + 22 uF for hot-plugged chain cables. J1/J2 12V and GND pass straight through (3 A)."
    (at 22.86 116.84 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "501c04ed-4ca6-4d20-b1bb-f1628ccc0497")
  )
  (text "WS2811 outputs sink when ON; R4-R6 pull up; 74HC04 inverts so DIM is HIGH = LED on."
    (at 116.84 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f29dc420-5820-4d3e-96d6-6a5b6748bbd4")
  )
  (text "J1 and J2 (JST XH, back of the board) share one pinout: 1 = 12V, 2 = data, 3 = GND."
    (at 101.6 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b30ee93f-77e7-49c5-a536-d0bc7d5e5590")
  )
  (text "PT4115 loop (datasheet): +12V -> Rs -> J3 x+ -> LED -> J3 x- -> L -> SW; Schottky SW -> +12V.  I_LED = 0.1 V / Rs = 455 mA"
    (at 30.48 137.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6a873f50-b610-48ad-962a-282993f12ba3")
  )
  (text "J3 = LED harness (JST PH 6, front of the board): 1 R+  2 R-  3 G+  4 G-  5 B+  6 B-. Twist each +/- pair."
    (at 30.48 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c84e886e-47ae-45cb-87a6-ec192694a66e")
  )
